  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Current release:\n      * Initial release of the VisualDiceRoller Blazor component.\n      * AddDiceNotationBlazor registers the dice library and the component services together.\n      * DiceRollerOptions configures tray size, theme, visual settings, simulation settings, and reduced motion.\n      * Built-in DiceTheme presets: Default, DarkFantasy, and Parchment.\n      * Shape-aware rendering and physics for d2, d4, d6, d8, d10, d12, d20, and d100.",
